# The Earthmen's leader (build 97d): object $28 (loc_4DD8), the only object
# on Noah F1's sprite list, at 33,7 -- the far end of the corridor, two
# cells above where the walk to the Earthmen stops. Before 97d the port
# left his slot empty (the figure was not ported), so the Earthmen's
# "Welcome to the spaceship Noah" was spoken to bare floor.
#
# He stands from the level's load whatever the flags: here Mother Brain
# not yet fought. His init runs every frame -- frame 0, hit-box row 4 --
# so he blocks the way and never moves; his $2E is 0, so A at him is
# event 0, "nothing unusual here" ($1708).

start level $64 33 10
party 4 50
wait idle
expect flag $C747 0
expect object $28 visible
shot 01_standing
walk up 1
wait step
wait idle
expect level $64 33 9
walk up 1
wait step
wait idle
expect level $64 33 8
objects
shot 02_face_to_face
press a
wait idle
expect script $1708
shot 03_nothing_unusual
press c
wait idle
press up                     # he blocks the step: still on 33,8
wait ticks 30
wait idle
expect level $64 33 8
